DESCRIPTION:Join with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/xim-btxi-kcw\n
 \nWhy Your Position Keeps Slipping (and How to Fix It)\n\nAlmost every r
 ider has a version of it. The collapsing side you can't seem to shake\, 
 the swinging lower leg that shows up the second you get tired\, the boun
 cy sitting trot that never quite lets you settle. Most of us have our co
 aches repeat the same few cues lesson after lesson\, and no matter how h
 ard we try\, we keep defaulting back to old habits!\n\nIn this session w
 e'll break down the most common rider position faults and where they act
 ually come from. Beyond the surface-level "just soften your hands" or "s
 houlders back" cues that never seem to click\, diving into the underlyin
 g strength\, mobility\, and motor control patterns that create the fault
  in the first place (and what to actually do to change them off the hors
 e).\n\nYou'll learn how to identify your own position patterns\, why som
 e corrections stick and others don't\, and how targeted off-horse strate
 gies can produce bigger changes in your riding than another year of stru
 ggling to get them to click.
